<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use — ASMR Registry" description="Terms governing use of ASMR Registry, a curated ASMR video directory." canonical="/terms/">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 1, 2026</p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>ASMR Registry is a curated directory of ASMR videos hosted on YouTube. We do not host video content. All videos are embedded from YouTube via their official embed API and remain the property of their respective creators.</p>

    <h2>No medical advice</h2>
    <p>Some categories on this site reference health conditions including anxiety, insomnia, depression, headaches, ADHD, and tinnitus. ASMR content is not a medical treatment, therapy, or clinical intervention. Nothing on this site constitutes medical advice. If you are experiencing a health condition, consult a qualified healthcare professional.</p>

    <h2>Content accuracy</h2>
    <p>Video classification (triggers, intents, intensity) is generated by AI analysis and may contain errors. We do not guarantee the accuracy of any classification. View counts and channel information are sourced from the YouTube Data API and may be outdated.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Video thumbnails are served from YouTube's image CDN. Video titles and channel names are public metadata from the YouTube Data API. Editorial content on pillar and guide pages is original work by ASMR Registry.</p>
    <p>If you are a content creator and want a video removed from this directory, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@asmrregistry.com">hello@asmrregistry.com</a> with the video URL and we will remove it promptly.</p>

    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep this site available but do not guarantee uptime. The directory is updated daily but content may be temporarily unavailable during maintenance.</p>

    <h2>Links</h2>
    <p>This site links to YouTube, NHS, and other third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of external sites.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@asmrregistry.com">hello@asmrregistry.com</a></p>
    <p>See also: <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/about/">About ASMR Registry</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
